B.a72=s(["Finish setup: your profile, Stripe payouts, and the agreement.","Browse open jobs and bid with your price and the day and time you can arrive.","If you win, the address unlocks once the customer's payment is secured.","Tap Heading to customer, share your location, then tap I've arrived on site.","Confirm the start, send additional work requests for approval, and post updates.","Get paid to your Stripe account. Customer privacy and keeping jobs on YCYC are non-negotiable."],t.s)
